                                                "sense_id": "e9759729-d65c-3274-81bd-6ca675939c3c",
                                                "text": "I'd count not wearisome / Long toil, nor enterprise, / But strain to reach it; aye, with wrestlings stout / And hopes that even in the dark will grow[…]"
